  "result": {
    "text": "Promising medicines need rigorous trials. Operational delays keep patients waiting. Meet Protocol Pulse. Open a trial protocol. AI extracts inclusion and exclusion criteria into source-linked rules. A clinical lead reviews and approves. Screen the patient cohort. See potential matches, conflicts, and missing evidence. An order alone doesn't prove medication use. Confirm participation, then add a new medication record. Approved rules flag a conflict. AI investigates and drafts a cited summary. The clinical lead reviews the evidence and records the next step. Less repetitive work saves teams time. More efficient trials could help new medicines reach the patients who need them sooner. Protocol Pulse, keep the trial moving.",
    "language_code": "eng",
    "language_probability": 1,
